<scroll-view class="page-scroll" scroll-y enhanced="{{true}}" show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
<view class="page">
  <view class="form-card">
    <text class="card-title">申请退款</text>
    <text class="form-desc">制作前提交后立即退款；制作中或待取餐的订单由商家审核后处理。</text>
    <text class="form-desc">退款金额以实际支付流水为准：只退已付金额，含预定菜的订单只退已付定金，到店尾款未收取不退。</text>
    <text class="form-desc">含预定菜的定金原则上不退，如商家无法履约请联系门店由后台发起。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <text class="card-title">退款原因</text>
    <input class="reason-input" value="{{reason}}" placeholder="请说明退款原因（选填）" maxlength="200" bindinput="onReasonInput" />
  </view>

</view>
</scroll-view>
  <view class="action-bar">
    <view class="ghost-btn" bindtap="onBack" hover-class="ghost-btn--hover">返回</view>
    <view class="primary-btn {{submitting ? 'primary-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit" hover-class="primary-btn--hover">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交申请'}}
    </view>
  </view>
